| CPU kernel | `TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(myops, CPU, m) { m.impl("myadd", myadd_cpu); }` |
| CUDA kernel | `TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(myops, CUDA, m) { m.impl("myadd", myadd_cuda); }` |
| No-autograd fallback | `TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(myops, Autograd, m) { m.impl(op, autogradNotImplementedFallback()); }` |
| In-place/view extra | `TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(myops, ADInplaceOrView, m) { m.impl(op, autogradNotImplementedInplaceOrViewFallback()); }` |
